{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-coffee-tsx","path":"/en/coffee/la-batalla/","result":{"data":{"gramoCoffee":{"databaseId":46,"slug":"la-batalla","title":"La Batalla – Lavado de Veracruz","nameEn":"La Batalla – Washed Veracruz","descriptionEn":"Our house washed coffee, grown in Xico, in the coffee highlands of Veracruz. A kind, steady cup — almond, caramel and butter — made to carry the morning without asking permission. Medium roast by Gramo Coffee Roasters, our own label in Mexico City. 250 g bag; also available in a 1 kg format.","content":"<p>Nuestro lavado de casa, cultivado en Xico, en la sierra cafetalera de Veracruz. Una taza amable y constante — almendra, caramelo y mantequilla — hecha para acompañar la mañana sin pedir permiso.</p>\n<p>Tueste medio de Gramo Coffee Roasters, nuestro sello propio en la Ciudad de México. Bolsa de 250 g; también disponible en presentación de 1 kg.</p>\n","origin":"Xico, Veracruz","producer":null,"altitude":null,"variety":null,"process":{"es":"Lavado","en":"Washed"},"roastLevel":"medio","tastingNotes":[{"noteEs":"Almendra","noteEn":"Almond"},{"noteEs":"Caramelo","noteEn":"Caramel"},{"noteEs":"Mantequilla","noteEn":"Butter"}],"brewMethods":[{"methodEs":"Filtrado (V60)","methodEn":"Pour over (V60)"},{"methodEs":"Espresso","methodEn":"Espresso"},{"methodEs":"Prensa francesa","methodEn":"French press"}],"harvest":null,"availability":"permanente","subscriptionInterval":null,"price":300,"purchasable":true,"imageUrl":"http://localhost:8888/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/la-batalla.jpg","imageAlt":"Bolsa de café La Batalla, lavado de Veracruz, sobre fondo neutro.","localImage":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#181818","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/5508a27fb0f4565e6f88204e74b672bc/7bd9a/la-batalla.jpg","srcSet":"/static/5508a27fb0f4565e6f88204e74b672bc/2579c/la-batalla.jpg 250w,\n/static/5508a27fb0f4565e6f88204e74b672bc/2ff65/la-batalla.jpg 500w,\n/static/5508a27fb0f4565